{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Crystal Conquest</i></strong> is a <strong>Free-To-Play</strong> VR game where you <strong>control the elements</strong> and battle for victory. Harness the power of fire, water, earth, and air in epic 3v3 MOBA-inspired combat or intense dueling modes! Team up with your friends against AI or choose to fight in PvP! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/b474c18fd0a9f8ebc4f5b4fc5730d8b6.poster.avif?t=1761356832\" width=800 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/b474c18fd0a9f8ebc4f5b4fc5730d8b6.webm?t=1761356832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/b474c18fd0a9f8ebc4f5b4fc5730d8b6.mp4?t=1761356832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your mage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the class that matches your playstyle and elements. Unlock class variants as you grow and customize your build.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/975b4dcbd76b30d5b2141dadd1094ad5.poster.avif?t=1761356832\" width=800 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/975b4dcbd76b30d5b2141dadd1094ad5.webm?t=1761356832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/975b4dcbd76b30d5b2141dadd1094ad5.mp4?t=1761356832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >H<strong>arness the elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle with elemental magic where each element has unique properties. Use earth, fire, water, and wind to block, dodge, and deflect your enemy's attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/6c8c14b64b2046d6791b2b9f9b94cd41.poster.avif?t=1761356832\" width=800 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/6c8c14b64b2046d6791b2b9f9b94cd41.webm?t=1761356832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/6c8c14b64b2046d6791b2b9f9b94cd41.mp4?t=1761356832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow in Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and unlock even more epic spells that change how you control the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/8b6a785cb7ebc75b980c99dba8507727.poster.avif?t=1761356832\" width=800 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/8b6a785cb7ebc75b980c99dba8507727.webm?t=1761356832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/8b6a785cb7ebc75b980c99dba8507727.mp4?t=1761356832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Battle Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in 3v3 matches to capture crystals and topple towers, face off in duels, or team up in co-op to take on waves of AI. All modes support AI for solo or practice play.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/